{"id":"8107070d99d9c69c","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-cor-pathology.md","title":"Vitali Pathology Corollary","display":"cor-pathology — Vitali Pathology Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-pathology","aliases":["58-cor-pathology"],"display":"cor-pathology — Vitali Pathology Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-df-vitali-set]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","[[58-ax-ac]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-pathology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-pathology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-pathology — Vitali Pathology Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e1e1a22b5758041\" href=\"?note=9e1e1a22b5758041\" title=\"58-df-vitali-set\">58-df-vitali-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> (实数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (Lebesgue-measurability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}pathology} \\vdash \\exists E \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\\;(\\neg\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(E))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}pathology} \\vdash \\exists E \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\\;(\\neg\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(E))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vitali showed that AC implies non-measurable sets exist.</li>\n<li>This is a fundamental pathology caused by the axiom of choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-vitali-set","status":"resolved","id":"9e1e1a22b5758041","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vitali-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-ac]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S$ (Lebesgue-measurability predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}pathology} \\vdash \\exists E \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\\;(\\neg\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(E))","display":true}],"bytes":731,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-co